{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"I’m implementing the storefront as a lightweight static frontend plus Vercel serverless endpoints. This keeps the public surface fast and dependency-light, while keeping Stripe and Scalable Press credentials entirely server-side. The checkout will collect the shipping address in Stripe-hosted Checkout, which avoids handling raw card details or shipping PII in the storefront."}}
