{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"web_search_instructions":"Find Scalable Press API v2 quote endpoint documentation, specifically the required address fields and sample request for a DTG product using a designId. Return concise relevant details and official URLs."},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"toolshed_web_search","tool":"call_web_search","arguments":{"web_search_instructions":"Find Scalable Press API v2 quote endpoint documentation, specifically the required address fields and sample request for a DTG product using a designId. Return concise relevant details and official URLs."},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Research Report: Scalable Press API v2 Quote Endpoint Documentation\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nThe Scalable Press API v2 provides a Quote endpoint that allows users to obtain precise pricing for Direct-to-Garment (DTG) products using a specified designId. To generate an order-ready quote, the API requires comprehensive shipping address details and product specifications. The official documentation offers clear guidelines and sample requests to facilitate integration.\n\n## Key Findings\n\n- **Finding 1:** The Quote API requires detailed shipping address fields, including `name`, `address1`, `city`, `state`, and `zip`, to generate an order-ready quote.\n\n- **Finding 2:** A sample request for a DTG product includes parameters such as `type=dtg`, `products` array with product details, `address` object with shipping information, and a `designId` referencing the specific design.\n\n- **Finding 3:** The API distinguishes between \"order-ready\" and \"quote-only\" scenarios, where missing required fields like `designId` or address details result in a quote that cannot be converted into an order.\n\n- **Finding 4:** Authentication is mandatory for API requests, utilizing HTTP Basic authentication with the API key as the password.\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Source Analysis\n\n### Source 1: API Documentation\n\n- **URL:** [https://scalablepress.com/docs/](https://scalablepress.com/docs/)\n\n- **Domain:** scalablepress.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Official Documentation\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official documentation from Scalable Press)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe Scalable Press API documentation provides comprehensive details on the Quote API, which allows users to obtain exact pricing before placing an order. It outlines the requirements for generating both \"order-ready\" and \"quote-only\" responses, emphasizing the necessity of including all required fields such as `designId` and complete shipping address information. The documentation also includes sample requests and responses to guide users through the process.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Required address fields: `name`, `address1`, `city`, `state`, `zip`\n\n- Sample request includes `type=dtg`, `products` array, `address` object, and `designId`\n\n- Authentication via HTTP Basic with API key as password\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Standard quotes allow a single design printed on one or more products, shipped to a single address.\"\n\n> \"Authentication headers are required.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 2: Developer API | Print & Ship Products with Simple API Calls\n\n- **URL:** [https://scalablepress.com/api](https://scalablepress.com/api)\n\n- **Domain:** scalablepress.com\n\n- **Publication Date:** Date not specified\n\n- **Source Type:** Official Documentation\n\n- **Credibility:** High (Official documentation from Scalable Press)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis source provides an overview of the Scalable Press API, highlighting its capabilities for programmatically sending customized products. It emphasizes the ease of integration, fast turnaround times, and the absence of minimum order quantities. The documentation includes examples of creating a design object, which is a prerequisite for obtaining a quote and placing an order.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- No minimum order quantities\n\n- Orders typically ship within 1-3 business days\n\n- Multiple production centers in CA, IN, and PA\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"We believe ordering customized products should be as simple and inexpensive as ordering normal products. This starts with our API.\"\n\n> \"Create a design object. Upload an artwork file, along with dimensions and placement specifications, to create a design object.\"\n\n---\n\n### Source 3: Scalable Press — API Provider, Schemas | APIs.io Providers\n\n- **URL:** [https://apis.io/providers/scalablepress/](https://apis.io/providers/scalablepress/)\n\n- **Domain:** apis.io\n\n- **Publication Date:** Last month\n\n- **Source Type:** API Directory\n\n- **Credibility:** Medium (Third-party API directory)\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThis source lists the Scalable Press API among other APIs, providing metadata such as the base URL, available operations, and authentication methods. It outlines the various endpoints, including those for retrieving quotes and placing orders, and specifies the use of HTTP Basic authentication.\n\n**Key Data Points:**\n\n- Base URL: `https://api.scalablepress.com/v2`\n\n- Authentication: HTTP Basic\n\n- Operations: Retrieve quote, place order, retrieve single order, reprint order, change order address, cancel order\n\n**Notable Quotes:**\n\n> \"Scalable Press Order API declares 1 security scheme for authenticating requests. It accepts HTTP basic authentication (`basicAuth`).\"\n\n> \"Requests are made against a single base URL, `https://api.scalablepress.com`.\"\n\n---\n\n## Cross-Reference Analysis\n\n**Consensus Across Sources:**\n\n- All sources agree on the necessity of including complete shipping address details and a valid `designId` to generate an order-ready quote. ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n- Authentication via HTTP Basic with the API key as the password is consistently emphasized. ([scalablepress.com](https://scalablepress.com/docs/?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Conflicting Information:**\n\n- No significant conflicting information was identified across the sources.\n\n**Information Gaps:**\n\n- The documentation does not specify the handling of international addresses or the inclusion of optional address fields like `address2` or `phone`.\n\n- Further details on error handling and response codes for various scenarios could enhance the documentation.\n\n---\n\n## Research Metadata\n\n- **Search Completed:** 2026-08-22T23:18:13Z\n\n- **Sources Analyzed:** 3 sources\n\n- **Total Content Reviewed:** Approximately 1,200 words\n\n- **Search Confidence:** High (Based on official documentation and reputable sources)\n\n--- "}],"_meta":{"openai/widgetSessionId":"4ec46a25-b14d-4b27-8509-72b6479055bc"},"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_42","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"curl -L -sS https://scalablepress.com/docs/ | rg -n -i -C 2 'quote|address1|orderToken|next-level' | sed -n '1,180p'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_42","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"curl -L -sS https://scalablepress.com/docs/ | rg -n -i -C 2 'quote|address1|orderToken|next-level' | sed -n '1,180p'\"","aggregated_output":"184-        \n185-          <h1 id=\"overview\">Overview</h1>\n186:<p>The Scalable Press API is a comprehensive REST service for viewing the product catalog, making quotes, and completing orders for our printing and fulfillment services.</p>\n187-\n188-<p>Requests are made using standard GET, POST, and DELETE requests. All responses are JSON.</p>\n--\n230-</aside></p>\n231-<h2 id=\"list-product-categories\">List product categories</h2>\n232:<blockquote>\n233-<p>DEFINITION</p>\n234:</blockquote>\n235-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>GET {{base}}{{print.categories.base}}\n236-</code></pre></div>\n237:<blockquote>\n238-<p>EXAMPLE REQUEST</p>\n239:</blockquote>\n240-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.categories.base}}\"</span>\n241-</code></pre></div>\n242:<blockquote>\n243-<p>EXAMPLE RESPONSE</p>\n244:</blockquote>\n245-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight json\"><code><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n246-  </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n--\n300-</tbody></table>\n301-<h2 id=\"list-products\">List products</h2>\n302:<blockquote>\n303-<p>DEFINITION</p>\n304:</blockquote>\n305-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>GET {{base}}{{print.categories.base}}/{categoryId}\n306-</code></pre></div>\n307:<blockquote>\n308-<p>EXAMPLE REQUEST</p>\n309:</blockquote>\n310-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.categories.base}}/sweatshirts\"</span>\n311-</code></pre></div>\n312:<blockquote>\n313-<p>EXAMPLE RESPONSE</p>\n314:</blockquote>\n315-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight json\"><code><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n316-  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Garment\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n--\n402-</tbody></table>\n403-<h2 id=\"list-product-information\">List product information</h2>\n404:<blockquote>\n405-<p>DEFINITION</p>\n406:</blockquote>\n407-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>GET {{base}}{{print.products.base}}/{productId}\n408-</code></pre></div>\n409:<blockquote>\n410-<p>EXAMPLE REQUEST</p>\n411:</blockquote>\n412-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew\"</span>\n413-</code></pre></div>\n414:<blockquote>\n415-<p>EXAMPLE RESPONSE</p>\n416:</blockquote>\n417-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight json\"><code><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n418-  </span><span class=\"nl\">\"comments\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Generous fit. Soft, sturdy, easy to move around in, all the while looking good.\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n--\n652-</tbody></table>\n653-<h2 id=\"list-product-availability\">List product availability</h2>\n654:<blockquote>\n655-<p>DEFINITION</p>\n656:</blockquote>\n657-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>GET {{base}}{{print.products.base}}/{productId}/availability\n658-</code></pre></div>\n659:<blockquote>\n660-<p>EXAMPLE REQUEST</p>\n661:</blockquote>\n662-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew/availability\"</span>\n663-</code></pre></div>\n664:<blockquote>\n665-<p>EXAMPLE RESPONSE</p>\n666:</blockquote>\n667-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight json\"><code><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n668-   </span><span class=\"nl\">\"red\"</span><span class=\"p\">:{</span><span class=\"w\">\n--\n733-<p><strong>There will be an attribute for each available size</strong></p>\n734-<h2 id=\"list-detailed-item-information\">List detailed item information</h2>\n735:<blockquote>\n736-<p>DEFINITION</p>\n737:</blockquote>\n738-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>GET {{base}}{{print.products.base}}/{productId}/items\n739-</code></pre></div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.products.base}}/gildan-sweatshirt-crew/items\"</span>\n740-</code></pre></div>\n741:<blockquote>\n742-<p>EXAMPLE RESPONSE</p>\n743:</blockquote>\n744-<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight json\"><code><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n745-   </span><span class=\"nl\">\"antique sapphire\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n--\n843-</tbody></table>\n844-\n845:          <h1 id=\"quote-api\">Quote API</h1>\n846:<p>The Quote API lets you get an exact quote before placing an order. When using this API, it is important to understand the three possible outcomes:</p>\n847-\n848-<ul>\n849:<li><a href=\"#order-ready-scenario\">Order-ready</a> &mdash; quote is successful and the information sent to the API is enough to place an actual order</li>\n850:<li><a href=\"#quote-only-scenario\">Quote-only</a> &mdash; quote is successful but the information sent is not sufficient to place an order</li>\n851:<li><a href=\"#error-scenario\">Error</a> &mdash; quote is unsuccessful due to the information being sent to the API is either invalid or incomplete</li>\n852-</ul>\n853-\n854:<p><a href=\"#standard-quote\">Standard quotes</a> allow a single design printed on one or more products, shipped to a single address. <a href=\"#bulk-quote\">Bulk quotes</a> allow greater flexibility for multiple printing orders and split shipping.</p>\n855-\n856:<p>Besides making a quote, the Quote API can also be used to <a href=\"#retrieve-quote\">retrieve a quote</a> which was previously completed. The quote API can also <a href=\"#breakdown\">breakdown</a> a bulk quote&rsquo;s pricing into a per item basis.</p>\n857-\n858:<p>In order to receive a quote and place an order for any of these advanced features, the <a href=\"#bulk-quote\">bulk quote API</a> should be used:</p>\n859-\n860-<ul>\n--\n864-</ul>\n865-\n866:<p>A bulk quote with a <a href=\"#single-design\">single but unspecified design</a> can be generated to estimate post-discount pricing.</p>\n867-\n868:<p>The Quote API also allows for <a href=\"#custom-order-features\">custom order features</a> for your order:</p>\n869-\n870-<ul>\n--\n878-</aside></p>\n879-<h2 id=\"order-ready-scenario\">Order-ready scenario</h2>\n880:<blockquote>\n881-<p>DEFINITION</p>\n882:</blockquote>\n883:<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>POST {{base}}{{print.quote.base}}\n884:POST {{base}}{{print.quote.bulk}}\n885-</code></pre></div>\n886:<blockquote>\n887-<p>EXAMPLE REQUEST</p>\n888:</blockquote>\n889:<div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"{{base}}{{print.quote.base}}\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n890-  <span class=\"nt\">-u</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"{{username}}:{{apiKey}}\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n891-  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"type=dtg\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n--\n895-  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"products[0][size]=lrg\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n896-  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[name]=My Customer\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n897:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[address1]=123 Scalable Drive\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n898-  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"address[city]=West Pressfield\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n899-  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span