{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"agent_message","text":"The second deployment corrected the first heuristic but revealed the opposite edge case: once the local-only server is ignored, Vercel wants an explicit static output directory. I’m adding a tiny static build command so the frontend is unambiguously emitted as static assets while the `/api` functions remain serverless."}}
